# The Ultimate Doom E4M8 (M9): started beside line 877 (special 52, tag 0), on its
# back, the player walks across it, then waits for the movers it set going
# (at most 450 tics). Written by tools/RouteGen (doom-e4m8-line877).
iwad doom
map E4M8
exit normal
start -2368 64 90

# forwardmove sidemove turn buttons [xcount]; turn << 8 = angleturn
0 0 0 0
25 0 0 0 x10
